  README, documentation, about screen or paper, and cite it as below. State
  what you changed. Attribution does not imply that we endorse your project.
type: software
title: "opensensor-space-firmware. OpenSensor firmware for ESP32-S3 Things"
abstract: >-
  Native ESP-IDF firmware by Walkthru.Earth for ESP32-S3 Things that log
  sensor measurements as Parquet on a microSD card and sync them over BLE or
  the local network without internet. Boards plug in sensors through logger
  hooks and a field dictionary. Air quality is the first sensor set.
